  <h2 class="section-heading">Class Policy, Rules, and Regulations</h2>
  <ul class="plain-list">
    <li>Any devices or other equipment that distracts you, other students, or the instructor should not be used during lectures except in emergencies.</li>
    <li>Missing a lecture can (and probably will) lead to a domino effect. If you miss a lecture, you are strongly recommended to study the material you missed before you return to class. You are responsible for all the material covered in class. So, in case you miss a lecture:
      <ul>
        <li>Photocopy, and read notes from someone who was in class,</li>
        <li>Read the relevant sections from the lecture notes, textbooks, and make an Internet search if necessary,</li>
      </ul>
      After you have done this, you may contact the instructor if you need clarification on any materials.
    </li>
  </ul>

